<title>USA: Automatic Data buys benefits management firm.</title>
<headline>Automatic Data buys benefits management firm.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automatic Data Processing Inc said Monday it acquired Health Benefits America, a benefits management firm.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
